{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## Task\n\nWhat is user's citizenship?\n\n## Tool Use\n\nUse the provided tool `extracted_data` to extract correct and accurate structured data from the input.\n\nTool purpose: Function call based on user instructions.\n\nCall the tool with the best supported arguments for the requested extraction."},{"role":"user","content":"His name is Jason, he is 28 years old American who lives in Germany."}],"max_completion_tokens":1024,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data","description":"Function call based on user instructions.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"citizenshipGroup":{"description":"Select correct option","type":"string","enum":["US","Canada","Germany","Other"]}},"required":["citizenshipGroup"]}}}],"tool_choice":{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data"}},"reasoning_effort":"none"}